<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>September 11, 2001 — A Timeline</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink: #EDE9E3;
    --ink-dim: #A9A39A;
    --ground: #0C0C0E;
    --ground-raised: #131315;
    --bronze: #9C7A50;
    --bronze-dim: #6B5638;
    --ember: #A6402C;
    --steel: #4C5A68;
    --line: #2A2A2C;
    --serif: Georgia, "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", "Book Antiqua", serif;
    --sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--ground);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:92vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:6vh 6vw;
    position:relative;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .hero .date{
    font-family:var(--sans);
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:0.85rem;
    margin-bottom:2.2rem;
  }
  .hero .big-time{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:clamp(4.5rem, 16vw, 11rem);
    line-height:0.95;
    color:var(--ink);
    font-weight:400;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
  }
  .hero .big-time span{
    color:var(--bronze);
  }
  .hero .sub{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    max-width:38ch;
    margin-top:1.6rem;
    line-height:1.5;
    font-style:italic;
  }
  .hero .scroll-cue{
    position:absolute;
    bottom:3.5vh;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
  }
  .hero .scroll-cue .arrow{
    display:block;
    margin:0.4rem auto 0;
    width:1px;
    height:28px;
    background:linear-gradient(var(--ink-dim), transparent);
  }

  /* ---------- INTRO ---------- */
  .intro{
    max-width:640px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:9vh 6vw 7vh;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .intro p{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:1.15rem;
    line-height:1.75;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
  }

  /* ---------- TIMELINE ---------- */
  .timeline-wrap{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:2vh 6vw 10vh;
    position:relative;
  }

  .timeline-rail{
    position:absolute;
    left:calc(6vw + 100px);
    top:0;
    bottom:0;
    width:1px;
    background:var(--line);
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    .timeline-rail{ left:38px; }
  }

  .event{
    position:relative;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:100px 1fr;
    gap:2.4rem;
    padding:2.6rem 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .event:last-child{ border-bottom:none; }

  @media (max-width:720px){
    .event{ grid-template-columns:38px 1fr; gap:1.4rem; }
  }

  .event .time-col{
    text-align:right;
    padding-top:0.15rem;
  }
  .event .time{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:1.05rem;
    color:var(--bronze);
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    .event .time-col{ text-align:left; }
    .event .time{ font-size:0.72rem; writing-mode:vertical-rl; text-orientation:mixed; }
  }

  .event .dot{
    position:absolute;
    left:calc(6vw + 100px);
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    top:2.9rem;
    width:9px;
    height:9px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--ground);
    border:1px solid var(--bronze);
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    .event .dot{ left:38px; }
  }
  .event.impact .dot{ background:var(--ember); border-color:var(--ember); }
  .event.collapse .dot{ background:var(--steel); border-color:var(--steel); }

  .event .content h3{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-weight:400;
    font-size:1.4rem;
    margin:0 0 0.55rem;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .event .content .tag{
    display:inline-block;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius:2px;
    margin-bottom:0.7rem;
  }
  .event.impact .tag{ color:#D98A78; border-color:#4a2b24; }
  .event.collapse .tag{ color:#9db1c4; border-color:#2e3a44; }

  .event .summary{
    font-size:0.98rem;
    line-height:1.65;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    max-width:56ch;
  }

  .event .toggle{
    margin-top:0.9rem;
    background:none;
    border:none;
    color:var(--bronze);
    font-family:var(--sans);
    font-size:0.85rem;
    cursor:pointer;
    padding:0;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.4rem;
  }
  .event .toggle:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--bronze);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }
  .event .toggle .chevron{
    display:inline-block;
    transition:transform 0.25s ease;
    font-size:0.7rem;
  }
  .event.open .toggle .chevron{ transform:rotate(90deg); }

  .event .detail{
    max-height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:max-height 0.35s ease;
  }
  .event.open .detail{
    max-height:400px;
  }
  .event .detail-inner{
    padding-top:1rem;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--ink);
    max-width:58ch;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top:0.9rem;
  }
  .event .detail-inner ul{
    margin:0.6rem 0 0;
    padding-left:1.1rem;
  }
  .event .detail-inner li{
    margin-bottom:0.35rem;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
  }

  /* ---------- LEGEND ---------- */
  .legend{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 6vw 3vh;
    display:flex;
    gap:1.8rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
  }
  .legend .item{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem; }
  .legend .swatch{ width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block; }
  .legend .swatch.impact{ background:var(--ember); }
  .legend .swatch.collapse{ background:var(--steel); }
  .legend .swatch.other{ background:var(--bronze); border:1px solid var(--bronze); }

  /* ---------- TOLL ---------- */
  .toll{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:8vh 6vw;
    text-align:center;
    background:var(--ground-raised);
  }
  .toll .figure{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:clamp(3rem, 9vw, 5.5rem);
    color:var(--ink);
    margin:0;
  }
  .toll .label{
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    margin-top:0.6rem;
  }
  .toll .breakdown{
    margin-top:3rem;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:4vw;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .toll .breakdown div{
    min-width:120px;
  }
  .toll .breakdown .n{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-size:1.7rem;
    color:var(--bronze);
  }
  .toll .breakdown .l{
    font-size:0.78rem;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
    margin-top:0.3rem;
  }

  /* ---------- CLOSING ---------- */
  .closing{
    max-width:600px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:10vh 6vw 12vh;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .closing p{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .closing .attribution{
    margin-top:1.2rem;
    font-style:normal;
    font-size:0.8rem;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
  }

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:3rem 6vw 4rem;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    color:var(--ink-dim);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="date">TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 11, 2001 — NEW YORK, VIRGINIA &amp; PENNSYLVANIA</div>
  <h1 class="big-time">8:<span>46</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">The moment the morning changed. What follows is a timeline of the 102 minutes that reshaped the day — and the two decades after it.</p>
  <div class="scroll-cue">SCROLL<span class="arrow"></span></div>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <p>On the morning of September 11, 2001, four commercial aircraft were hijacked by 19 terrorists affiliated with al-Qaeda. Two struck the World Trade Center in Lower Manhattan, one struck the Pentagon, and one crashed in a field in Shanksville, Pennsylvania, after passengers and crew fought back. Below is a chronology of that morning's key moments, drawn from the 9/11 Commission Report and contemporaneous accounts.</p>
</section>

<div class="legend">
  <div class="item"><span class="swatch impact"></span>Impact</div>
  <div class="item"><span class="swatch collapse"></span>Collapse</div>
  <div class="item"><span class="swatch other"></span>Other key moment</div>
</div>

<section class="timeline-wrap">
  <div class="timeline-rail"></div>

  <div class="event" data-id="1">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">7:59 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">DEPARTURE</span>
      <h3>American Airlines Flight 11 departs Boston</h3>
      <p class="summary">A Boeing 767 bound for Los Angeles leaves Logan International Airport with 92 people on board. It is hijacked shortly after takeoff.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>Five hijackers took control of the cockpit within the first half hour of the flight. Flight attendants managed to alert American Airlines ground staff by phone, providing some of the first evidence that a hijacking was underway.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event impact" data-id="2">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">8:46 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">IMPACT</span>
      <h3>Flight 11 strikes the North Tower</h3>
      <p class="summary">The hijacked aircraft crashes into the North Tower (1 WTC) between floors 93 and 99, killing everyone aboard and hundreds inside the building instantly.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>The impact severed all three stairwells above the crash zone, trapping more than 1,300 people on the floors above. Initial news reports described the event as a possible accident until the second impact made clear it was an attack.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event" data-id="3">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">9:03 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">IMPACT</span>
      <h3>Flight 175 strikes the South Tower</h3>
      <p class="summary">United Airlines Flight 175, also hijacked after departing Boston, crashes into the South Tower (2 WTC) between floors 75 and 85, live on national television.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>Because the first impact had already drawn news cameras to Lower Manhattan, this second crash was broadcast live, and the nation understood within minutes that the United States was under a coordinated attack.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event" data-id="4">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">9:37 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">IMPACT</span>
      <h3>Flight 77 strikes the Pentagon</h3>
      <p class="summary">American Airlines Flight 77, hijacked after departing Washington Dulles, crashes into the western side of the Pentagon in Arlington, Virginia.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>The crash killed all 64 people aboard and 125 people inside the building. The impact occurred in a section that had recently been reinforced, which limited the collapse to a portion of the building.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event" data-id="5">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">9:42 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">RESPONSE</span>
      <h3>FAA grounds all U.S. air traffic</h3>
      <p class="summary">For the first time in history, the Federal Aviation Administration orders every aircraft in the United States to land at the nearest airport.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>Roughly 4,500 flights were in the air at the time. The order, along with a closure of airspace over the U.S. and Canada, brought commercial aviation to a nationwide halt within hours.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event collapse" data-id="6">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">9:59 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">COLLAPSE</span>
      <h3>The South Tower collapses</h3>
      <p class="summary">Fifty-six minutes after being struck, the South Tower collapses in roughly ten seconds, sending a wall of dust and debris through Lower Manhattan.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>Fire, fueled by jet fuel and office contents, weakened the tower's structural steel until it could no longer bear the load above the impact zone. Firefighters and civilians were still evacuating both towers when it fell.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event" data-id="7">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">10:03 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">CRASH</span>
      <h3>Flight 93 crashes near Shanksville, Pennsylvania</h3>
      <p class="summary">United Airlines Flight 93, the fourth hijacked plane, crashes into a field after passengers and crew, aware of the earlier attacks, attempt to retake the cockpit.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>Phone calls from passengers to family and emergency dispatchers made clear that a passenger revolt was underway. The plane's intended target is believed to have been a building in Washington, D.C., possibly the U.S. Capitol.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event collapse" data-id="8">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">10:28 AM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">COLLAPSE</span>
      <h3>The North Tower collapses</h3>
      <p class="summary">One hour and forty-two minutes after impact, the North Tower collapses, completing the destruction of the World Trade Center's twin towers.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>The longer survival time compared to the South Tower was due to the different location of impact and fire spread, but ultimately the same structural failure occurred. Rescue operations were still ongoing when it fell.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="event collapse" data-id="9">
    <div class="time-col"><span class="time">5:21 PM</span></div>
    <div class="content">
      <span class="tag">COLLAPSE</span>
      <h3>7 World Trade Center collapses</h3>
      <p class="summary">A third tower, the 47-story 7 World Trade Center, collapses in the evening after burning for hours, having been damaged by debris from the North Tower.</p>
      <button class="toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        <span class="chevron">›</span> Read more
      </button>
      <div class="detail">
        <div class="detail-inner">
          <p>The building had been evacuated earlier in the day and no one was killed in its collapse. It later became a focus of engineering studies on how fire alone, without direct aircraft impact, can bring down a steel high-rise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<section class="toll">
  <p class="figure">2,977</p>
  <p class="label">PEOPLE KILLED, EXCLUDING THE 19 HIJACKERS</p>
  <div class="breakdown">
    <div><div class="n">2,753</div><div class="l">World Trade Center, New York</div></div>
    <div><div class="n">184</div><div class="l">The Pentagon</div></div>
    <div><div class="n">40</div><div class="l">Flight 93, Shanksville</div></div>
    <div><div class="n">343</div><div class="l">FDNY firefighters lost</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="closing">
  <p>"No day shall erase you from the memory of time."</p>
  <div class="attribution">Inscribed at the National September 11 Memorial, New York City</div>
</section>

<footer>
  Sources: The 9/11 Commission Report; National September 11 Memorial &amp; Museum; National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) building performance studies.
</footer>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.event').forEach(function(ev){
    var btn = ev.querySelector('.toggle');
    if(!btn) return;
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var isOpen = ev.classList.toggle('open');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isOpen ? 'true' : 'false');
      btn.querySelector('span:last-child') ? null : null;
      btn.lastChild.textContent = isOpen ? ' Show less' : ' Read more';
    });
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
